### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET /v1/orders — List orders (paged, filtered)
### OrderController.listOrders
### Query params:
###   - buyerId (optional, UUID)
###   - status  (optional, OrderStatus enum)
###   - page    (default 0)
###   - size    (default 20)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

@orderBase = {{host}}/v1/orders

###
# @name list-orders-default
### [1] Default paging - no filters
GET {{orderBase}}?page=0&size=20

###
# @name list-orders-buyer-only
### [2] Filter by buyerId only
GET {{orderBase}}?buyerId={{buyerId}}&page=0&size=20

###
# @name list-orders-status-only
### [3] Filter by status only
GET {{orderBase}}?status=PENDING&page=0&size=20

###
# @name list-orders-buyer-status
### [4] Filter by buyerId + status
GET {{orderBase}}?buyerId={{buyerId}}&status=CONFIRMED&page=0&size=20

###
# @name list-orders-small-page
### [5] Small page size
GET {{orderBase}}?buyerId={{buyerId}}&page=0&size=5

###
# @name list-orders-page-out-of-range
### [6] Page index beyond results (expect empty)
GET {{orderBase}}?buyerId={{buyerId}}&page=999&size=20

###
# @name list-orders-invalid-status
### [7] Invalid status enum (expect 400)
GET {{orderBase}}?status=NOT_A_STATUS&page=0&size=20
